lso ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," until the start of your next turn. This is a Mind-Affecting effect.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
